          "question": "Discuss in comprehensive detail the main themes, moral values, and life lessons presented in 'Simplicity and Humility of Hazrat Muhammad (PBUH)'.",
          "answer": "Comprehensive Analysis of 'Simplicity and Humility of Hazrat Muhammad (PBUH)':\n\n1. Central Theme & Orientation:\nThis unit highlights the exceptional simplicity and humility of Hazrat Muhammad (PBUH). Despite being the leader of Arabia and the final messenger of Allah, he lived in humble quarters, wore modest clothes, ate plain food, mended his own shoes, and treated rich and poor equally. Simplicity in speech, dress, and lifestyle was declared by the Prophet to be an essential part of faith.\n\n2. Key Supporting Details:\nThe lesson provides thorough illustrations and narrative depth, guiding students to appreciate the depth of the subject matter.\n\n3. Moral & Practical Relevance:\nIt inspires youth to pursue excellence, cultivate humility and fortitude, and contribute constructively to society.",
