    "pashtoTranslation": "دا کیسه د دوو صمیمی ملګرو د دوستۍ او اتلولۍ ده چې په باکسنګ کې سره مخامخ کیږي او دا ثابتوي چې ورورولي او مینه له هرې بریا څخه لوړه ده.",
    "englishTranslation": "Set in Lyari, Karachi, this narrative follows two childhood friends and devoted boxers, Antonio and Felix (Ali and Faisal in the adapted context), who train together. When matched against each other in the Golden Gloves championship, they worry their bond might shatter. In the ring, both fight with utmost ferocity and skill. However, before the decision is announced, they embrace and leave arm in arm, proving true champions cherish brotherhood above trophies.",
