          "answer": "Comprehensive Analysis of 'The Aged Mother':\n\n1. Central Theme & Orientation:\nIn ancient Shinano, a cruel feudal governor decrees that all elderly citizens must be abandoned on mountain peaks to die. A devoted poor farmer carries his beloved mother to Mount Obatsuyama, but as they climb, she thoughtfully drops snapped twigs to guide his return journey. Moved to tears by her selfless love, he secretly conceals her at home. Later, her wisdom solves the governor's impossible riddles, prompting the ruler to abolish the barbaric law and honor the elders.\n\n2. Key Supporting Details:\nThe lesson provides thorough illustrations and narrative depth, guiding students to appreciate the depth of the subject matter.\n\n3. Moral & Practical Relevance:\nIt inspires youth to pursue excellence, cultivate humility and fortitude, and contribute constructively to society.",
