          "rule": "Adverbs modify verbs, adjectives, or other adverbs, answering How? When? Where? or To what extent? Most adverbs of manner are formed by adding -ly to adjectives (quick → quickly). If ending in -y, change to -ily (heavy → heavily). If ending in -le, change to -ly (terrible → terribly). Irregular: good → well, hard → hard, fast → fast.",
