          "rule": "When converting questions into Indirect Speech: change reporting verb 'said to' into 'asked' or 'inquired'; use 'if' or 'whether' for yes/no questions, or retain the wh-word; and shift the inverted question word order into statement word order (Subject + Verb) with past tense backshifting.",
