eng10Unit10.exercise.comprehension=[
 {question:'What are the main sources of water in Pakistan?',answer:'Rainfall, surface water in rivers, and underground water are the main sources. The lesson also describes glacial water and the river drainage basins.',answerType:'suggested source-based answer'},
 {question:'What are the river drainage systems of Pakistan? Describe them briefly.',answer:'The three basins are the Indus Basin River, the closed basin of the Kharan Desert, and the Makran coastal basin. The Indus system and the Kharan and Makran basins each have their own tributaries and sources of water.',answerType:'suggested source-based answer'},
 {question:'What are the main causes of water shortage in Pakistan? Discuss in detail.',answer:'The lesson identifies construction of dams and barrages on the Chenab and Jhelum, population growth, global warming and climate change, groundwater depletion and contamination, and limited water-storage capacity.',answerType:'suggested source-based answer'},
 {question:'What measures can we take to overcome water shortage in Pakistan?',answer:'Implement the National Water Policy 2018 and a National Action Plan, construct reservoirs, control excessive groundwater pumping and wastage, increase water-efficient crops, use conservative agriculture, and adopt sprinkler and drip irrigation.',answerType:'source-based answer'},
 {question:'What can you do on your own to contribute to conservation of water in your home and surrounding?',answer:'Example response: turn off taps when they are not needed, repair leaks, reuse suitable water, and avoid wasting water at home.',answerType:'example personal response'},
 {question:'What is the importance of building national reservoirs? Can you point out a spot in your area where small reservoirs can be built to benefit the local population?',answer:'Reservoirs store water for later use and help manage shortages. The location part is a local-response question; learners should identify a suitable safe site in their own area.',answerType:'source-based answer plus local response'}
];
